      "section": "Section 4, full body",
      "text": "If a majority of the qualified voters voting at said election shall vote in favor of the approval of this ordinance, the tax provisions hereof shall be binding and shall become effective April 1, 2027, and shall automatically terminate ten years after that date, March 31, 2037."
